          %h2#references References
          %p The notion of (co)ends as introduced in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nobuo+Yoneda"}> Nobuo Yoneda
              , §4 of:
              %em On ext and exact sequences
              (PhD thesis), Journal of the Faculty of Science, Section I.
              %strong 8
              University of Tokyo (1960) 507–576 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://alpha.math.uga.edu/~lorenz/YonedaExtExactSequences.pdf"}> pdf
              ,
              %a{:href => "https://ci.nii.ac.jp/naid/500000325773"} CiNii:naid/500000325773
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://web.archive.org/web/20250228145236/http://alpha.math.uga.edu/~lorenz/YonedaExtExactSequences.pdf"} archived
          %p
            An early account with an eye towards application in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+realization+of+simplicial+topological+spaces"} geometric realization of simplicial topological spaces
          %ul
            %li#MacLane70
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Saunders+MacLane"}> Saunders MacLane
              , Section 2 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Milgram bar construction as a tensor product of functors
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Steenrod Algebra and Its Applications: A Conference to Celebrate N.E. Steenrod’s Sixtieth Birthday
              = succeed "," do
                %em 168
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BFb0058523"} doi:10.1007/BFb0058523
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/BFb0058523.pdf"} pdf
          %p Textbook accounts:
          %ul
            %li#Kelly82
